       "data": "Out[1032]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site-1 weight of basis vector} & \\text{v\\_new component identically 0}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,0,1\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2,0\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,0,2\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,2,1\\right\\} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{(i) all of V (x) V: total dim, reached} & \\left\\{64,6\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{(ii) highest-weight states: total, reached} & \\left\\{6,5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{hw weight nu (irrep of V (x) V)} & \\text{\\# hw states} & \\text{rank reached}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} & 1 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f48627a0-6b4f-4526-a483-bf553676ad55"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Parameter dependence of the per-weight leading orders. In 1-dim weight spaces every parameter is an overall factor;\n   in the octet sector (1,1,1) everything but k1 factors out, and the direction (2 k1 - 1, 1) is what gives rank 2.\n   Rank of the (1,1,1) family with each parameter group frozen at generic values shows which parameters carry the rank. ---- *)\nClearAll[freezeRankC, octC];\noctC = leadWC[{1, 1, 1}][[2]];\nfreezeRankC[vars_] := rankC[octC /. Thread[vars -> Table[RandomInteger[{2, 50}] / RandomInteger[{2, 50}], Length[vars]]]];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[\n        Prepend[\n            KeyValueMap[{#1, If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, \"-\", Superscript[\"ε\", #2[[1]]]], If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, 0, Factor[DeleteCases[#2[[2]], 0]]]} &, leadWC],\n            {\"weight of V\", \"leading order\", \"nonzero components\"}\n        ],\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ],\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\"rank of the (1,1,1) family, all parameters free\", rankC[octC]},\n            {\"k1 frozen\", freezeRankC[{k1}]},\n            {\"k2 frozen\", freezeRankC[{k2}]},\n            {\"p1, p2, φ frozen\", freezeRankC[{p1, p2, φ[1], φ[2], φ[3]}]},\n            {\"everything except k1 frozen\", freezeRankC[{k2, p1, p2, φ[1], φ[2], φ[3]}]}\n        },\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
