yle=\"height:9.1411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.4822em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.1411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.6822em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.1411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.0822em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.1411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.2822em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.1411em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.6411em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1042]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{t-hat commutes with E11, E22, E33} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{weights in the support of e1\\^{}T e\\^{}\\{a E12\\} t-hat} & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 & 0\\\\2 & 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{Cauchy-Binet: t\\^{}G\\_2 from the general formula} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{covariance: g0 t\\^{}G\\_2 g0\\^{}-1 = t\\^{}\\{G1\\}\\_2} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{G1 = g0 G g0\\^{}-1} & \\begin{pmatrix}z\\left(1\\right) & p1\\,\\left(z\\left(2\\right)-z\\left(1\\right)\\right) & 0\\\\0 & z\\left(2\\right) & \\frac{p2\\,\\left(z\\left(1\\right)-z\\left(3\\right)\\right)}{p1}\\\\0 & 0 & z\\left(3\\right)\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{G1 at z = e\\^{}\\{$\\varphi$ $\\varepsilon$\\}, O($\\varepsilon$)} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\varepsilon \\,\\varphi \\left(1\\right)+1 & \\varepsilon \\,p1\\,\\left(\\varphi \\left(2\\right)-\\varphi \\left(1\\right)\\right) & 0\\\\0 & \\varepsilon \\,\\varphi \\left(2\\right)+1 & \\frac{\\varepsilon \\,p2\\,\\left(\\varphi \\left(1\\right)-\\varphi \\left(3\\right)\\right)}{p1}\\\\0 & 0 & \\varepsilon \\,\\varphi \\left(3\\right)+1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "28661797-7034-4a4e-a50a-fb8cd1dd900c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### The determinant covector of `L2-det-mathcalA.wb`: $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\otimes\\langle v_1|$\n\nThere (adjoint): $D_A\\langle k_2^{u/h}p\\,Q_{12}\\rangle=C\\,\\big(\\langle v_1|(1-k_2\\hat t)\\big)\\otimes\\langle v_1|\\,|\\Psi_A\\rangle=C\\,\\langle v_{\\rm tot}\\otimes v_1|\\Psi_A\\rangle$. Now site 2 carries $\\langle v_1|=(1-k_1z_1)e_1^Tg_1$, $g_1=e^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}}=e^{aE_{12}}g_0$, $a=p_1'-p_1$. Undo it globally: $(\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\otimes\\langle v_1|)(g_1^{-1}\\otimes g_1^{-1})=\\langle v'_{\\rm new}|\\otimes e_1^T$ with $\\langle v'_{\\rm new}|=(1-k_1z_1)\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|g_1^{-1}=(1-k_1z_1)\\langle v_{\\rm new}|e^{-aE_{12}}$. Since $g_1\\in N_+$ fixes every highest-weight vector of $V\\otimes V$, the hw pairings are unchanged by this step. Then untwist and count exactly as in cells 4–5, for $v'_{\\rm new}$ alone and for the union with the old family $v_{\\rm new}$.\n\n**Result (exact).** $v_1g_1^{-1}=(1-k_1z_1)e_1^T$, so $v'_{\\rm new}=(1-k_1z_1)^2e_1^T(1-k_2\\,g_1\\hat tg_1^{-1})$: the $E_{12}$ shift is gone. $v'_{\\rm new}\\equiv0$ at site-1 weights $(1,2,0),(0,2,1),(1,0,2),(0,1,2)$; octet $(1,1,1)$ direction $(-1,1)$, rank 1. hw states reached: new family **3/6** ($[4,2,0],[4,1,1]$, one octet), combined with the old **5/6** — **the singlet is still missed**, and $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}\\otimes v_1|\\text{singlet}\\rangle=0$ exactly at finite twist (cell 10). Reason: an $N_+$ rotation of site 2 can be moved onto site 1 without touching hw states, and $v_{\\rm new}e^{-aE_{12}}$ cannot fill $(0,1,2)$ because $v_{\\rm new}$ is zero at both $(1,0,2)$ and $(0,1,2)$.\n\n**What would reach it (cell 10, hypothetical):** a $\\hat t$ insertion on **both** sites. $\\langle v_1\\hat t\\otimes v_1\\hat t|\\text{singlet}\\rangle=\\tfrac12p_2^2(z_1-z_2)^2(z_1-z_3)^2\\neq0$ ($O(\\varepsilon^4)$, $k_1$-independent), while one-site insertions give 0. Realizing it needs a second $\\langle k_2^{u/h}p\\,Q_{12}\\rangle$ with site-2 poles.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. v'_new = (1 - k1 z1) v_tot . g1^-1, g1 = the site-2 rotation of v1 (depends on k1). Same untwisting / per-weight leading order /\n   rank / hw-pairing as cells 4-5; \"combined\" = union of the old family (v_new) and the new one (v'_new) in each weight space. ---- *)\nClearAll[g1C, vnew2C, leadWOf, leadW2C, hwFixedC, exactZero2C, pairRankOf, rowsHW2C, combMat];\ng1C = MatrixExp[p1pC EC[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 EC[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3C EC[2, 3]];\nvnew2C = Together /@ ((1 - k1 z[1]) vtotC . Inverse[g1C]);\n(* the global g1 (x) g1 fixes every hw vector of V (x) V (E_ij, i<j, annihilate them) *)\nhwFixedC = And @@ Flatten @ Table[Simplify[KroneckerProduct[g1C, g1C] . w - w] === ConstantArray[0, dC^2], {nu, Select[Union[wt2C], hwC[#] =!= {} &]}, {w, hwC[nu]}];\nexactZero2C = Table[{wtC[[n]], Simplify[vnew2C[[n]]] === 0}, {n, dC}];\n\n(* per-weight-space leading order of a family, as in cell 4 *)\nleadWOf[vec_] := Module[{ser, ord},\n    ser = Table[Normal[Series[c /. z[k_] :> Exp[φ[k] ε], {ε, 0, 5}]], {c, vec}];\n    ord = Table[With[{cl = CoefficientList[Together[s], ε]}, With[{nz = Flatten @ Position[Simplify /@ cl, _?(# =!= 0 &), {1}, Heads -> False]}, If[nz === {}, Infinity, First[nz] - 1]]], {s, ser}];\n    Association @ Table[\n        With[{nW = Min[ord[[sec]]]},\n            wtC[[First[sec]]] -> {nW, Table[If[MemberQ[sec, n] && nW < Infinity, Simplify[Coefficient[ser[[n]], ε, nW]], 0], {n, dC}]}\n        ],\n        {sec, sectorsC}\n    ]\n];\nleadW2C = leadWOf[vnew2C];\n(* coefficient matrix of the family (rows = monomials); zero family -> a zero row *)\ncombMat[lws_List] := Join @@ Table[If[FreeQ[lw, Except[0, _?NumericQ | _Symbol | _φ]] || lw === ConstantArray[0, dC], {ConstantArray[0, dC]}, coefMatC[lw]], {lw, lws}];\npairRankOf[mu_, lws_List] := With[{hw = hwC[mu + lamC]},\n    If[hw === {}, 0, MatrixRank[combMat[lws] . Transpose[Table[Partition[w, dC][[All, 1]], {w, hw}]]]]\n];\nrowsHW2C = Table[\n    With[{mu = nu - lamC},\n        {nu, Length[hwC[nu]], pairRankOf[mu, {leadWC[mu][[2]]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadW2C[mu][[2]]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadWC[mu][[2]], leadW2C[mu][[2]]}]}\n    ],\n    {nu, Select[Union[wt2C], hwC[#] =!= {} &]}\n];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\"v1 . g1^-1 = (1 - k1 z1) e1^T\", Simplify[v1C . Inverse[g1C] - (1 - k1 z[1]) UnitVector[dC, 1]] === ConstantArray[0, dC]},\n            {\"g1 (x) g1 fixes all hw vectors of V (x) V\", hwFixedC},\n            {\"v'_new = (1 - k1 z1) v_new . e^{-a E12}\", Simplify[vnew2C - (1 - k1 z[1]) vnewC . MatrixExp[-(p1pC - p1) EC[1, 2]]] === ConstantArray[0, dC]}\n        },\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ],\n    Grid[Prepend[Transpose[{exactZeroC[[All, 1]], exactZeroC[[All, 2]], exactZero2C[[All, 2]]}], {\"site-1 weight\", \"v_new component ≡ 0\", \"v'_new component ≡ 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[\n        Prepend[\n            KeyValueMap[{#1, If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, \"-\", Superscript[\"ε\", #2[[1]]]], If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, 0, Factor[DeleteCases[#2[[2]], 0]]], If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, 0, rankC[#2[[2]]]]} &, leadW2C],\n            {\"weight of V\", \"leading order of v'_new\", \"nonzero components\", \"rank\"}\n        ],\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ],\n    Grid[Prepend[Append[rowsHW2C, {\"total\", Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 2]]], Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 3]]], Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 4]]], Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 5]]]}],\n        {\"hw weight nu\", \"# hw states\", \"rank: old v_new\", \"rank: new v'_new\", \"rank: combined\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"83\" data-out-n=\"1053\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"32\" data-sub-end=\"51\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1053]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:33.77em;vertical-align:-16.635em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:17.135em;\"><span style=\"top:-22.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.695em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v1 . g1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1 = (1 - k1 z1) e1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g1 (x) g1 fixes all hw vectors of V (x) V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v’_new = (1 - k1 z1) v_new . e</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">{-a E12}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"