  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Direct finite-twist checks on the singlet (no untwisting, no rotation argument).\n   (i) the determinant covector v_tot (x) v1 is orthogonal to it exactly;\n   (ii) HYPOTHETICAL, not yet realized by a functional: a t-hat insertion on BOTH sites, v1 (1 - k2 t-hat) (x) v1 (1 - k2' t-hat).\n   Its k2 k2' term pairs the (1,1,1) components of the two sites, whose weights add to (2,2,2). ---- *)\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"<v_tot (x) v1 | singlet>\", Simplify[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[vtotC, v1C]] . First[hwC[{2, 2, 2}]]]},\n        {\"<v1 t-hat (x) v1 t-hat | singlet>  (the k2 k2' term)\", Factor[Simplify[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1C . tHatC, v1C . tHatC]] . First[hwC[{2, 2, 2}]]]]},\n        {\"<v1 (x) v1 t-hat | singlet>, <v1 t-hat (x) v1 | singlet>\", Simplify[{Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1C, v1C . tHatC]] . First[hwC[{2, 2, 2}]], Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1C . tHatC, v1C]] . First[hwC[{2, 2, 2}]]}]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557204\" data-output-id=\"451\" data-out-n=\"2352\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[2352]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.754em;vertical-align:-1.607em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.107em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.107em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.714em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.607em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.107em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.267em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;v_tot (x) v1 | singlet&gt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.953em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;v1 t-hat (x) v1 t-hat | singlet&gt; (the k2 k2’ term)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.753em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;v1 (x) v1 t-hat | singlet&gt;, &lt