  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### The transfer-matrix family $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|\\,t_{\\{2,1\\}}(\\theta_1)$\n\nFrom `L2-localizing-transfer.wb` (exact at two points, all $p_1,p_2$): $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|t_{\\{2,1\\}}(\\theta_1)=\\tau^{\\rm vac}\\,\\langle e_1^T\\hat G^{-1}g_0\\hat G\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|$, where $\\hat G=\\mathrm{diag}(z^\\mu)$ is the twist in the rep. Undo $g_0\\otimes g_0$ as before, which leaves $\\langle v_{t}|\\otimes e_1^T$ with $\\langle v_t|=e_1^T\\hat G^{-1}g_0\\hat Gg_0^{-1}$ (dropping the scalar $\\tau^{\\rm vac}$). Then untwist and count as in cells 4–6, alone and together with the old families.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. v_t = e1^T Ghat^-1 g0 Ghat g0^-1: site-1 covector from <vacL (x) vacL| t_{2,1}(θ1) after undoing g0 (x) g0. As a 3x3 matrix\n   G^-1 g0 G g0^-1 = G^-1 G1 is upper unitriangular with zero (1,3) entry (vacL relation), i.e. e^{y E23} e^{x E12}. ---- *)\nClearAll[GhatC, vtC, leadWtC, exactZeroTC, rowsHW3C];\nGhatC = DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[z[i]^EC[i, i][[n, n]], {i, 3}], {n, dC}]];\nvtC = Together /@ (UnitVector[dC, 1] . Inverse[GhatC] . g0C . GhatC . Inverse[g0C]);\nexactZeroTC = Table[{wtC[[n]], Simplify[vtC[[n]]] === 0}, {n, dC}];\nleadWtC = leadWOf[vtC];\nrowsHW3C = Table[\n    With[{mu = nu - lamC},\n        {nu, Length[hwC[nu]], pairRankOf[mu, {leadWtC[mu][[2]]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadWC[mu][[2]], leadW2C[mu][[2]]}],\n         pairRankOf[mu, {leadWC[mu][[2]], leadW2C[mu][[2]], leadWtC[mu][[2]]}]}\n    ],\n    {nu, Select[Union[wt2C], hwC[#] =!= {} &]}\n];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[{\n        {\"G^-1 g0 G g0^-1 (3x3)\", MatrixForm[Simplify[Inverse[DiagonalMatrix[z /@ Range[3]]] . g0plainC . DiagonalMatrix[z /@ Range[3]] . Inverse[g0plainC]]]},\n        {\"<v_t | singlet (x)>: pairing of v_t (x) e1 with the singlet\", Simplify[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[vtC, UnitVector[dC, 1]]] . First[hwC[{2, 2, 2}]]]}\n    }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[Prepend[Transpose[{exactZeroTC[[All, 1]], exactZeroC[[All, 2]], exactZero2C[[All, 2]], exactZeroTC[[All, 2]]}], {\"site-1 weight\", \"v_new ≡ 0\", \"v'_new ≡ 0\", \"v_t ≡ 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[\n        Prepend[\n            KeyValueMap[{#1, If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, \"-\", Superscript[\"ε\", #2[[1]]]], If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, 0, Factor[DeleteCases[#2[[2]], 0]]]} &, leadWtC],\n            {\"weight of V\", \"leading order of v_t\", \"nonzero components\"}\n        ],\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ],\n    Grid[Prepend[Append[rowsHW3C, {\"total\", Total[rowsHW3C[[All, 2]]], Total[rowsHW3C[[All, 3]]], Total[rowsHW3C[[All, 4]]], Total[rowsHW3C[[All, 5]]]}],\n        {\"hw weight nu\", \"# hw states\", \"rank: v_t alone\", \"rank: old + det\", \"rank: old + det + v_t\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
