span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:17.695em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
