  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (cell 12, exact).** $G^{-1}g_0Gg_0^{-1}$ is upper unitriangular with zero $(1,3)$ entry, so it equals $e^{yE_{23}}e^{xE_{12}}$ with $x,y=O(\\varepsilon)$. Since $e_1^TE_{23}^2=0$, $\\langle v_t|$ never reaches the site-1 weights $(1,0,2)$ and $(0,1,2)$: those components are $\\equiv0$ at finite twist, the same zero pattern as $v_{\\rm new}$. Leading orders: $\\varepsilon^0$ at $(2,1,0)$, $\\varepsilon^1$ at $(2,0,1),(1,2,0)$, $\\varepsilon^2$ at $(1,1,1)$ (rank 1). hw states: $v_t$ alone reaches **4/6** ($[4,2,0],[4,1,1],[3,3,0]$, one $[3,2,1]$). Combined with old + det it is still **5/6**, so **nothing new**. $\\langle v_t\\otimes e_1|\\text{singlet}\\rangle=0$ exactly.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. Why the families stop at mu3 <= lambda2 (site-1 weight mu3 = irrep's nu3, since site 2 is e1^T). Two mechanisms:\n   (a) t-hat families (old v_new, det v'_new): the rotation part is e1^T e^{a E12} (mu3 = 0), and every quantum minor qminor_{I,J} is\n       weight-homogeneous with |I| = |J|, so it moves at most ONE unit into slot 3 whatever the twist; with <= lambda2 insertions, mu3 <= lambda2.\n       Checked exactly below for a completely general 3x3 twist M: e1^T e^{a E12} t^M_2(θ1) is still 0 at (1,0,2), (0,1,2).\n   (b) t_{2,1}(θ1) family: G^-1 g0 G g0^-1 has ZERO (1,3) entry (vacL relation) = e^{y E23} e^{x E12}, and e1^T E23^k = 0 for k > lambda2 - lambda3.\n   HYPOTHETICAL: v^(n) = e1^T G^-n g0 G^n g0^-1. For n = 2 the (1,3) entry is -p2 (z1 - z2)(z1 - z3)/z1^2 = O(ε^2), which opens E13.\n   NOT realized by t_{2,1}(θ1)^2: <vacL (x) vacL| t_{2,1}(θ1)^2 has rank 4 as a site-1 x site-2 matrix (L2-localizing-transfer cell 8),\n   because after one step the two sites carry different rotations and the one-site lemma needs the same rotation on both. ---- *)\nClearAll[vtnC, leadWt2C, rowsHW4C, genTwistZeroC];\ngenTwistZeroC = Module[{Mg = Array[mm, {3, 3}], r},\n    r = Expand[UnitVector[dC, 1] . MatrixExp[a EC[1, 2]] . tMC[Mg][θ[1]]];\n    Table[If[Simplify[r[[n]]] === 0, wtC[[n]], Nothing], {n, dC}]\n];\nvtnC[n_] := Together /@ (UnitVector[dC, 1] . MatrixPower[Inverse[GhatC], n] . g0C . MatrixPower[GhatC, n] . Inverse[g0C]);\nleadWt2C = leadWOf[vtnC[2]];\nrowsHW4C = Table[\n    With[{mu = nu - lamC},\n        {nu, Length[hwC[nu]], pairRankOf[mu, {leadWt2C[mu][[2]]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadWC[mu][[2]], leadW2C[mu][[2]], leadWtC[mu][[2]], leadWt2C[mu][[2]]}]}\n    ],\n    {nu, Select[Union[wt2C], hwC[#] =!= {} &]}\n];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[{\n        {\"(a) weights where e1^T e^{a E12} t^M_2(θ1) ≡ 0, M a general 3x3 twist\", genTwistZeroC},\n        {\"(b) (G^-n g0 G^n g0^-1)_{13}, n = 1, 2\", Table[Factor[(MatrixPower[Inverse[DiagonalMatrix[z /@ Range[3]]], n] . g0plainC . MatrixPower[DiagonalMatrix[z /@ Range[3]], n] . Inverse[g0plainC])[[1, 3]]], {n, 2}]},\n        {\"<v^(n) (x) e1 | singlet>, n = 1, 2\", Table[Factor[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[vtnC[n], UnitVector[dC, 1]]] . First[hwC[{2, 2, 2}]]], {n, 2}]},\n        {\"v^(2): leading order at site-1 weight (0,1,2)\", leadWt2C[{0, 1, 2}]}\n    }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[Prepend[Append[rowsHW4C, {\"total\", Total[rowsHW4C[[All, 2]]], Total[rowsHW4C[[All, 3]]], Total[rowsHW4C[[All, 4]]]}],\n        {\"hw weight nu\", \"# hw states\", \"rank: v^(2) alone (hypothetical)\", \"rank: all families + v^(2)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"88\" data-out-n=\"1079\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"30\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1079]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:16.2801em;vertical-align:-7.89em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.39em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.49em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.19em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.8001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.65em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(a) weights where e1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\